barely escape downwards.  You could keep wandering aimlessly in a part
of the dungeon where you are much outclassed in terms of weapon and
armor (and probably die) ... OR, if you see a pudding, you can start a
mini-farm and go for as long as necessary to get the equipment you need
to be able to survive. 

